  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short meaning stems of two to four words. Targets use un-, re-, or -ly with a clear kid base. Distractors come from other affix families.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of three to seven words. Mix dis-, un- on verbs, and -ful. Distractors may share a base or a close affix.",
    "3": "Near-miss stems of four to eight words. Pair un- versus re- or pre- on the same base, and -ful versus -less. One stem may use <NAME>."
